# Walking down a run of high ledges on Hang 'Em High, three falls one after
# another with the walking going on (and a wall brushed on the way): falls of
# one to three world units, each landed, with the stance and speed carried on.
scenario fall_steps
map hangemhigh
# <name> <x> <y> <z> <yaw, radians>: a little above the ground, so that the
# player settles on it in the first ticks
start steps 27.9078 -15.5764 -2.7 1.5708
ticks 210
input 30 210 forward=1.0

# what the Rust simulation may differ from the C engine by: falling and
# landing are the same arithmetic as walking (see walk_slope)
tolerance position 0.001
tolerance velocity 0.005
tolerance facing 0.001
tolerance state 0
